# star power probe (bsrl-sim issue #20), test-only: native/loader/cardprobe.c hooks libg's star power getters while
# NB_CARDPROBE=1 (player-level 0xc42838 getCard / 0xc42874 getValue / 0xc428b0 / 0xc428ec, config-level 0xc34be0 / 0xc34c6c
# for the callers that skip the player wrapper) and logs each ability type the game asks a player for, what it got and the
# caller. env.c div_reset clears its dedup state (cardprobe_reset); div_publish calls cardprobe_build after every RESET to
# log each player's star power card (+0x100 type, MetaType, player+0x238 "cards off") and the sim's cards flag. Unset,
# nothing is hooked. star_probe.py reads the log. Applies on top of the earlier patches. Paths relative to engine/.
